
# Chart of Accounts — <ENTITY NAME>

**Last updated**: YYYY-MM-DD

Tax-basis chart of accounts. Lines map to Form 1120 / 1065 / 1120-S P&L and Schedule L fields.

## Account Numbering (optional convention)

- 1xxx — Assets
- 2xxx — Liabilities
- 3xxx — Equity
- 4xxx — Revenue
- 5xxx — COGS
- 6xxx — Operating expenses
- 7xxx — Other income
- 8xxx — Other expenses / taxes
- 9xxx — Non-cash / special

