## Nested Disregarded SMLLC Mapping

If this entity has a disregarded SMLLC, map the SMLLC's COA to these same lines. E.g., SMLLC's "Postage" → consolidated 6700 (office supplies). Keep a mapping table at `disregarded/<smllc-slug>/books/coa-mapping.md` so consolidation is mechanical.
